  "body": "Update urgency: `SECURITY`: There are security fixes in the release.\r\n\r\n### Security fixes\r\n\r\n- (CVE-2026-62356) Miscalculated buffer size in `CMSketch` RDB loading may lead to heap OOB write\r\n- Out-of-bounds access in TopK heap cleanup path (MOD-15410)\r\n- Use-after-free in the TLS pending-data list when a command closes another pending connection\r\n- A malicious RDB payload with an out-of-range `SLOT_INFO` slot id causes memory corruption during RDB loading, which may lead to Remote Code Execution\r\n- Vector Sets: missing node level validation when loading a vector set from RDB may lead to out-of-bounds access\r\n- Vector Sets: use-after-free when `VREM` mutates the HNSW graph while background `VSIM` threads are still running\r\n- Vector Sets: a negative `hnsw_search()` return was treated as a huge unsigned count, reading past the end of the result arrays\r\n- TLS client certificate authentication bypass: a Common Name containing an embedded NUL byte was truncated, allowing a client to authenticate as another (possibly privileged) ACL user\r\n- https://github.com/redis/redis/pull/15594 Use-after-free in the blocked-client list when reprocessing a command evicts another client blocked on the same key\r\n\r\n\nHashes\r\n=========\r\nMSYS2 Builds Hashes\r\n====================\r\n\r\nAlgorithm : SHA256\r\nHash      : 4E8F2F956ED92FEADF3F64B4E137ED34026438821E692E7AE22C9BBA5976607A\r\nPath      : D:\\a\\redis-windows\\redis-windows\\Redis-8.10.1-Windows-x64-msys2.zip\r\n\r\n\r\nAlgorithm : SHA256\r\nHash      : 8D7710C858EB9EF24685D040272FA42F6B045906CBAB14DC635697A20303AF1B\r\nPath      : D:\\a\\redis-windows\\redis-windows\\Redis-8.10.1-Windows-x64-msys2-with-Service.zip\r\n\r\nCygwin Builds Hashes\r\n====================\r\n\r\nAlgorithm : SHA256\r\nHash      : 5532F2CC38A0185556B648D25A0C2FF1CC58029F37FD76ECEB38736976DCB056\r\nPath      : D:\\a\\redis-windows\\redis-windows\\Redis-8.10.1-Windows-x64-cygwin.zip\r\n\r\n\r\nAlgorithm : SHA256\r\nHash      : E70EEA271F2B8D4BC113FE4A95331BEAA2CD4B22C4ED07C93C54E342CB1788DB\r\nPath      : D:\\a\\redis-windows\\redis-windows\\Redis-8.10.1-Windows-x64-cygwin-with-Service.zip\r\n\r\nFrom workflow: https://github.com/redis-windows/redis-windows/actions/runs/32091074661\r\n"
